      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お前、何者だ！\r\nそれ以上クリスタルに近付くな！",
        "official_en": "Whoever you are, don’t dare take another step toward the Crystal!",
        "real_en": "Who are you!? Don’t come any closer to the Crystal!"
