    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_010_01:010_01_007:e0df55dc",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_010_01",
        "key": "010_01_007",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_010_01:010_01_007:e0df55dc",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_010_01:010_01_007:e0df55dc",
        "jp_sha256": "1429db1b1edca6df9f3d45efcb9fe23abbf4b24b526a2065aa0a58da745fdf83",
        "official_en_sha256": "7688e09265af11c58741da6a0ad1b166979afadea32221c1dcba77a5d577c1bc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、それでも……。\r\n罪人は償わなければならないのだ。\r\n７００年の重き罪を。",
        "official_en": "And there can be no excuse. You must all atone for seven centuries of transgression.",
        "real_en": "Even so... Sinners must atone for the weight of seven hundred years of sin."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
