        "official_en_sha256": "29f81d2875b8f24edd07531d0022dd95b143e157e5461682cf8796f52270f26a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "生きて……世界を救って……。",
        "official_en": "Live, so that the land may be saved...",
